      "message_parsed": "<b><span style=\"font-size: 22px\">TorrentPier Cattle. Версия 2.4.6-alpha.1</span></b><br />\n<br />\n<img src=\"https://torrentpier.com/attachments/6459/\" alt=\"logos-hexagon-green&amp;blue@0,5x.png\" /><br />\n<br />\n<b>Ссылка:</b><br />\n<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/releases/tag/v2.4.6-alpha.1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Release 2.4.6-alpha.1 · torrentpier/torrentpier</a><br />\n<br />\n<b>Чейнджлог:</b><br />\n<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/compare/v2.4.5...v2.4.6-alpha.1\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">Comparing v2.4.5...v2.4.6-alpha.1 · torrentpier/torrentpier</a><br />\n<br />\n<h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-rocket-features\"></a>🚀 Features&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-rocket-features\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(ACP)</i> Added robots.txt editor (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1913\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1913</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/79bb13e17d07505be4d3a3c67223b4f591b66bfb\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">79bb13e</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(bbcode)</i> Added [nfo] and [pre] tags (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1923\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1923</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/f64c340563378a364e1f00c64b17ac1c79531302\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">f64c340</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(bbcode)</i> Implement color customization for [box] tag (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1920\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1920</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/4c24cb65bfebf307b717e985b169ea5d27df64f8\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">4c24cb6</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(install)</i> Autofill Host in robots.txt file (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1916\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1916</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/03eeb08ad185b6dcc99563f567297e41f4a56117\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">03eeb08</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(meta)</i> Minor improvements to description generation (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1926\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1926</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/4d0b2941e3ef6703ac2cd4c03524a93e688e0c39\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">4d0b294</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">Added ability to set page meta description (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1917\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1917</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7b8b9a0bbabc1dfbf56cac8c105ad158ae78c3a7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7b8b9a0</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-japanese-vacancy-button-new-translations\"></a>🈳 New translations&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-japanese-vacancy-button-new-translations\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">New Crowdin updates (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1925\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ug