orrentpier/pull/1908\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1908</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/6d0499dd0229d454d3af00f10151adc26a9e96a7\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">6d0499d</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\">New translations (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1906\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1906</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/8a3b12c1192678552a3186c1f58df9b4d7e5ba1b\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">8a3b12c</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-package-dependencies\"></a>📦 Dependencies&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-package-dependencies\" title=\"Permanent link\"></a></h3><ul>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(deps)</i> Bump filp/whoops from 2.18.0 to 2.18.1 (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1919\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1919</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/125366147c6257abadd489f3802e4a0dab37a89c\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">1253661</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(deps)</i> Bump arokettu/bencode from 4.3.0 to 4.3.1 (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1912\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1912</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/f76e351b32cfa2932bc1afde6c3c522cd993b8af\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">f76e351</a>)</li>\n</ul><h3 class=\"bbHeading\"><a class=\"u-anchorTarget\" name=\"-gear-miscellaneous\"></a>⚙️ Miscellaneous&#8203;<a class=\"hoverLink\" href=\"#-gear-miscellaneous\" title=\"Permanent link\"